{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-05-04 11:00:00', 'title': 'KROGER ANNOUNCES SECOND YEAR OF GO FRESH & LOCAL SUPPLIER ACCELERATOR', 'text': "AMERICA'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER INVITES LOCAL AND REGIONAL GROWERS AND PRODUCERS TO APPLY FOR ANNUAL ACCELERATOR PROGRAM CINCINNATI , MAY 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICA'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER, THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SECOND YEAR OF ITS GROUNDBREAKING GO FRESH & LOCAL SUPPLIER ACCELERATOR , A PROGRAM DESIGNED TO ENHANCE AND ACCELERATE THE SELECTION OF LOCAL ITEMS SOLD IN THE KROGER FAMILY OF COMPANIES. THE PROGRAM PROVIDES A PATHWAY TO ENTRY FOR LOCAL BUSINESSES OF ALL SIZES BY ALLOWING AMERICAN-BASED GROWERS AND PRODUCERS THE CHANCE TO WORK DIRECTLY WITH THE RETAILER."}